# --- e2e/output split (intentional) ---
# Throwaway / regenerable: screenshots, probe JSON, skill dumps, run progress, machine runs.
# Durable judgments live in docs/decisions/ (tracked). Do not force-add shot folders.
# If a review needs a shot, cite the path (e.g. e2e/output/design-review-r1/) — regenerate via e2e/*.mjs.
e2e/output/

# AI assistant harness (LOCAL ONLY — never commit / never push)
# Reason: branch checkouts must not swap the agent's brain or skills.
# Product docs about the in-app agent panel stay tracked (docs/04-agents.md, etc.).
# Full rule: docs/AGENTS_ROLES.md § "AI harness stays local"
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
